  "pipeline_contract": [
    "Spotify playlist snapshot is the order authority; Spotify supplies catalog metadata, artwork and ISRC only.",
    "YT Music search selects the recording; yt-dlp downloads only the exact selected music.youtube.com URL.",
    "LRCLIB synchronized lyrics are screened for Telugu script before expensive downstream alignment.",
    "Source audio derivatives and selected-video reference audio use content and recipe provenance manifests.",
    "Demucs retries/device fallbacks use isolated output locations; only validated stems from a successful attempt are promoted.",
    "The active Telugu word-alignment engine is src/phase2core; repaired word timing is validated before serialization.",
    "Whole-song 8D processing precedes full-song visual offset confidence checks and absolute-timeline Reel trimming."
  ],
